WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.648
"Oh no!" Jemima cried.

2
00:00:05.649 --> 00:00:09.246
"Where are Dora's babies?"

3
00:00:09.247 --> 00:00:12.840
"Quack!" Jemima's baby said.

4
00:00:12.841 --> 00:00:16.235
He was looking at the chicken house.

5
00:00:16.236 --> 00:00:19.911
Henny Penny was in the chicken house.

6
00:00:19.912 --> 00:00:22.632
So were Dora's ducklings!

7
00:00:22.633 --> 00:00:33.067
They were playing with the chicks.

8
00:00:33.068 --> 00:00:36.851
"Ducklings! Come here!" Jemima called.

9
00:00:36.852 --> 00:00:42.638
But ducklings and chicks ran everywhere.

10
00:00:42.639 --> 00:00:45.277
Henny Penny frowned.

11
00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:49.185
She clucked loudly.

12
00:00:49.186 --> 00:00:57.252
"Ducks do not belong in the chicken house!"

13
00:00:57.253 --> 00:01:05.659
Jemima gathered all the ducklings.

14
00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:11.931
They walked past the pond.

15
00:01:11.932 --> 00:01:15.855
"Water!" The biggest duckling quacked.

16
00:01:15.856 --> 00:01:22.095
He jumped in.

17
00:01:22.096 --> 00:01:32.189
The others jumped in too.

18
00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:35.552
"No!" Jemima cried.

19
00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:43.798
The five ducklings swam and splashed.

20
00:01:43.799 --> 00:01:51.856
They swam in the reeds.

21
00:01:51.857 --> 00:01:55.145
Then the ducklings swam across the pond.

22
00:01:55.146 --> 00:01:58.012
"No!" Jemima cried.

23
00:01:58.013 --> 00:02:01.603
"Wait for me!"

24
00:02:01.604 --> 00:02:03.133
Splash!

25
00:02:03.134 --> 00:02:08.387
Jemima rushed after the ducklings.

26
00:02:08.388 --> 00:02:10.363
Splash!

27
00:02:10.364 --> 00:02:22.605
So did her duckling.

